title: Credentials posted to a form-collector service
severity: high
score: 45
tags: phishing, exfil, credential-harvest
attack: T1567, T1056.003
description: A page that asks for a password, card, one-time code or recovery phrase POSTs
  to a form-backend or webhook service (Formspree, EmailJS, webhook.site...). This is a kit
  with no backend of its own. Contact forms on these services ask for none of these.
---
// A POST or PUT to a form-collector service (string exfiltration.form_collectors) ...
requests
| where host in (list("exfiltration.form_collectors")) and method in ("POST", "PUT")
// ... from a capture that asks for a password, a card, a one-time code or a recovery
// phrase.
| where exists(password_pages) or exists(card_pages) or exists(otp_pages) or exists(seed_pages)
| distinct host
